01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:29.000
Lecturer: Let's do the library example together on the board. Primary actor: Member. Goal: borrow a book.

152
01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:59.000
Lecturer: Step one, the member scans their library card at the kiosk. Step two, the system shows their account.

153
01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:29.000
Lecturer: Step three, the member scans the book. Step four, the system records the loan and shows the due date.

154
01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:59.000
Lecturer: Extensions: 1a, the card is not recognised; 3a, the book is reserved for someone else.

155
